OL,3,ABarclays cutting 5,000 jobs as it
OL,4,Aincreases reliance on AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarclays is cutting around 5,000 staff
OL,7,Fas it introduces more artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence (AI) into its work
OL,9,Fprocesses.
OL,11,FThe banking group said 1,000 posts had
OL,12,Falready been closed and it expects a
OL,13,Ffurther reduction of 4,000 to be
OL,14,Fcomplete by the end of this year,
OL,15,Famounting to around 5% of its global
OL,16,Fworkforce.
OL,18,FThe bank's cost reductions are focused
OL,19,Fon its UK retail bank, but some back
OL,20,Foffice functions for the UK are done in
OL,21,FIndia, where a significant proportion
OL,22,Fof the job cuts are expected to fall.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
